  "solution": "**Logic : First number = Square of second number - Square of third number**\n\nGiven :\n\n \n• \n \n(20, 6, 4)\n\n \n\n20 = (6)² - (4)²\n\n20 = 36 - 16\n\n20 = 20 (LHS = RHS)\n\nAnd, \n\n \n• (24, 7, 5)\n\n​24 = (7)² - (5)²\n\n24 = 49 - 25\n\n24 = 24 (LHS = RHS)\n\nSo,\n\n \n• Option - (1) : (65, 9, 4)​\n\n65 = (9)² - (4)²\n\n65 = 81 - 16\n\n**65 = 65 (LHS = RHS)**\n\n \n• Option - (2) : (22, 5, 2)\n\n​22 = (5)² - (2)²\n\n22 = 25 - 4\n\n22 ≠ 21 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n \n• Option - (3) : (40, 8, 5)\n\n​40 = (8)² - (5)²\n\n40 = 64 - 25\n\n20 ≠ 39 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n \n• Option - (4) : (42, 7, 3)\n\n​42 = (7)² - (3)²\n\n42 = 49 - 9\n\n42 ≠ 40 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, **\"Option - (1)\"** is the correct answer.\n\nb3:T1183",
